'CR_model_with_remote.R': used to process the input data and run the CR model 
                          incorporating 'remote captures'. The code can be run on 
                          an HPC cluster using the 'CR_model_with_remote.sbatch'
                          sbatch file. 
                          This model is in the discrete latent sate formulation. 
                          It is in the process of being marginalized
                          
                          
'CR_model_without_remote.R': used to process the input data and run the CR model 
                             that ignores 'remote captures'. The code can be run on 
                             an HPC cluster using the 'CR_model_without_remote.sbatch'
                             sbatch file. 
                             This model is in the marginalized formulation of CR
                             model which improves mixing, speeds-up convergence,
                             and reduces the time per iteration of the MCMC chain.
                          